---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About testsite"
  description="A small personal project about clear, practical notes and honest how-to writing."
>
  <section class="section">
    <h1>About testsite.</h1>
    <p>This is a personal project built as a clean, static place for practical notes. It is intentionally small.</p>
    <p>The focus is how-to content: one goal, one reusable action, one source, one check. If a note cannot be used again, it should be rewritten or deleted.</p>
    <p>The site is built with Astro, deployed to GitHub Pages, and kept close to plain HTML.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem">What this is</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted)">A public notebook for practical notes, reusable steps, and honest writing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem">What this is not</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted)">Not a productivity brand, not a course, not a template store. No newsletter wall.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted)">You can reach the project maintainer through GitHub issues in this repository.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">
      <a href="https://github.com/ismaelmmachado/testsite" style="font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">github.com/ismaelmmachado/testsite -></a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
